  "description": "Killer spec, killer value – from flowing berms to untamed backcountry, the CAPRA CORE 3 AL and its insatiable appetite for speed are ready to go toe to toe with the burliest terrain on the planet. This spec goes big in all areas, with a premium Öhlins suspension package to maximize your tuning options and SRAM transmission for bulletproof shifting under power. Want to keep it reckless? CAPRA CORE 3 has you covered. It's your call. We offer the CAPRA CORE 3 in aluminum or high-modulus carbon fiber, so you'll always get the frame you want – choose carbon for a performance edge or aluminum for that FULL METAL feeling.",
